    {"id":"at","type":"text","x":84,"y":162,"width":532,"height":68,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":440011,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"CONTROL / UI THREAD  (non-real-time — may allocate & lock)\n• BPM · time-sig · subdivision · accent pattern → build immutable GridState\n• user WAV → decode → resample (float) → build ClickSample\n• DAW transport position / locate","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":null,"originalText":"CONTROL / UI THREAD  (non-real-time — may allocate & lock)\n• BPM · time-sig · subdivision · accent pattern → build immutable GridState\n• user WAV → decode → resample (float) → build ClickSample\n• DAW transport position / locate","lineHeight":1.4},
